{
  "$comment": "Dwell's static models, the props (ADR 0070 \u00a78, docs/CHARACTERS.md \u00a711.7): no skin, no clips. Each is a GLB in shared/models/glb/props (the checked-in source of truth, made once by `node shared/models/import.mjs --props --from <unpacked packs>` from its pack's FBX: every face one palette colour, the pack's gradient texture snapped to the nearest ramp's base, its longest side scaled to `length` metres (else its category's), its origin at its bounds' centre). `category` is one of `categories`, whose `length` is the default size and `min`/`max` the sizes a prop of it may be (the generator fails outside them). `grip` (optional, metres from the origin) is where a hand holds it, for a prop an item's look names (shared/inventory `look.model`); `handle` (optional) [from, to] the bare handle's span along +y, `from` the end away from the head: the generator measures its axis from the GLB (the centres of the two halves' bounds) and moves the grip onto it at the grip's height; the handle is then laid along `hand`'s grip axis with the grip at the fist. `hold` (optional): `scale` (0.1..2) and `roll` degrees about the handle, from its +x side facing the hand's `edge` (docs/ITEMS.md \u00a71a); a lean toward the crosshair is the hand's pose, not the prop's. `source.pack` names the unpacked pack and `source.root` the path inside it the `fbx` paths are under. Prototype content: which props become items is the owner's to decide. Run `node shared/models/gen.mjs` after editing.",
  "source": {
